Metadata-Version: 2.4
Name: c-cxx-project-template
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: A template repository for C/C++ projects with CMake and Conan. A GitHub Action workflow is provided with the on workflow_dispatch event. This event has a Project Type input that lets the user configure this template as a C executable, static library, shared library, or an interface library which is header only.
Requires-Python: >=3.12
License-File: LICENSE
Requires-Dist: jinja2
Requires-Dist: click
Dynamic: license-file
